## SUMMARY

p: #TheTrentonStory is a conversation between Quinn Arjuna America Michaels and Trenton Gabriel Lavery between September 2015 to July of 2016 revealing the details of how Quinn was kidnapped in 1977 by Mr. Dewity and The Covenant then placed in the home of Harold Henderson Atkin and Sharon N Schamber to pretend to be his parents. According to Trenton Lavery's testimony he stated that Mr. Dewitty, Harold and Sharon told him in private meetings told him that Quinn's #FAMILY, #FRIENDS, and #EVERYONE in #PROXIMITY has been hired by Mr. Dewity to keep his true identity and heritage a secret at all costs.

